{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_title", "source_sha256": "3a85196222fb2daffd80b797a78b231a9f6875e8e49fda219077839c3f8461f6", "ja": "もしも笑ってくれたなら", "zh": "如果能对我露出笑容", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5490f8b66aaccbc34aa75a73911f07dad48e4cce0615c98f4db43d6f59a1c4cb", "ja": "捨て猫を拾った美奈子は、子どもから偽善\nだと言われる。保護した子猫も懐かない。\n好きで焼いているお節介だからとわかりつつ\nも沈んでしまう美奈子だが、誰かを笑顔に\nするために、それでも前を向くことを選ぶ。", "zh": "美奈子捡回收养了被遗弃的猫，却被小孩子说是伪善。\n救助的小猫也不亲近自己。\n美奈子虽明白这些全凭自己喜欢、多管闲事，\n却难免有些消沉。但为了让谁展露笑容，\n她还是选择继续向前看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1000_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "1381cbe9169ee6176b3c19df8dc93b9f4f50309cf4a00b7c8cb61e746c6cd7b1", "ja": "今日のお仕事、早く終わってよかったですね。\n桃子ちゃん、戻ったら軽く何か作ろうか？", "zh": "今天的工作能早点结束真是太好了。\n桃子，回去后要不要我简单做点什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "13fb9f602c93a43c029f76ea087503b0752da5e436fb164f0cd59125ab974228", "ja": "桃子は平気。美奈子さんこそ、休憩しなくていいの？\n最近、たくさんレッスン入れてるよね？", "zh": "桃子没事。美奈子姐姐才是，不用休息一下吗？\n最近安排了很多练习吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "8af02d2a5f95b70698db0ddd62a0606766bd08ead33042ee42e5e3122301b4fa", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。今度の曲ね、もっと上手に気持ちを込めて\n歌いたいな～って思ってるところがあって。", "zh": "没事的啦。下次这首歌啊，我总觉得\n还想唱得再更饱含情感一些呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "0b0e7558a32dab12de42b1b761df1e606fcacac268071213d4fa44f473e1c516", "ja": "そういうのもしっかり詰めておきたいんだ。\nでも、ありがとね♪", "zh": "那种地方我也想好好琢磨清楚。  \n不过，还是谢谢你啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3948e212a81767178106a6f9662c85f067756c72b0418269538bab4ac9ea109b", "ja": "やる気があるのはいいけど、無理しすぎないようにな。\n美奈子はたまに、考えすぎるところがあるから。", "zh": "有干劲是好事，不过别太勉强自己。\n美奈子有时候会想得太多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "9287aa9f7c7a309e7261258b9571dbc5536f43750e7d69144fdefd069c481287", "ja": "はーい！　気をつけます♪\n……あれ？", "zh": "好——！我会注意的♪\n……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "ac255ff1d47b86432a91db21debd5ddf290368b2dafac9d2a8fb1d63b07de82d", "ja": "あの子、何してるんだろう……\nダンボール箱、あんなところに置いて……。", "zh": "那个孩子在做什么呢……\n把纸箱放在那种地方……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b2018f51672580b19d1b49bd605dfa1a4756bedca24c4ec2142634864c984810", "ja": "うん？\n……確かに、なんだろうな。", "zh": "嗯？\n……确实，不知道是什么呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "f6b3b4518a48be3bc0a53bd603bd95113e3d55d45ad040da35ce589a98650c75", "ja": "！　お兄ちゃん、美奈子さん、今……\n猫の鳴き声、聞こえなかった？", "zh": "！哥哥，美奈子姐，刚才……你们没听见猫叫吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "2aa8d1f9b2d5153a34f711e7d3b2ae07992d93c49ee15637089f685f95c52995", "ja": "えっ！　……ね、ねえ、そこのキミ！\n突然ごめんね、あの……、その箱、何かな？", "zh": "诶！……那、那个，你！  \n突然这样不好意思，那个……，你手里的箱子是什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1011_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "14ef357ee251374f29041082b8abf44bf32239dcf04cbd5f64cccdb51228afd1", "ja": "……、ネコだけど。", "zh": "……只是只猫而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "bfa6a9a867c1be844cf7d77b5a2672dc49545b3b12cd324dacb4e20c58aeb9af", "ja": "……！　まさか、捨てるつもり？\nそんなのダメじゃない！", "zh": "……！　难不成，你打算扔掉它？\n那种事怎么行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1013_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "805f9668da3fb10e371aaecd77961fd73e61c6b28cd1e3384212ae502eb7af32", "ja": "オレじゃねぇよ！　ウチの前に捨てられてたんだから。\n母ちゃんアレルギーだし、しょうがないだろ。", "zh": "不是我啊！它是被扔在我家门口的。\n我妈过敏，也没办法吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
