{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "404f922b980358ec883582d9d3840587768ca7fee23858ee63e8efa3d84826c8", "ja": "待って！！\nじゃあ……その子、私に預けてもらってもいいかな？", "zh": "等等！！\n那……那个孩子，可以交给我来照顾吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2d86e4e7274e8ec7818fe08ab856d113da4795d5d588a555b83f8e98554138e1", "ja": "美奈子？　預けるって……家で飼えるのか？", "zh": "美奈子？你说托给你……你家能养它吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "1490e17c94136a0c485b5a889dd5ea04e5f521fb56c3725c39c6e60bc6ff916f", "ja": "家は……お店があるから、無理かもですけど……。\n大丈夫です、誰か飼ってくれる人を探します。", "zh": "家里……因为开着店，可能不太行……\n不过没关系的，我会找其他人来收养的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1020_p", "source_sha256": "edc045af1981631377f2cf79ae0fe8d2cc8c9d7c677c6771233aaed527868052", "ja": "でも、それまではどうするんだ？\n美奈子もご家族も忙しいんじゃ……。", "zh": "不过，在那之前怎么办？美奈子和你的家人不也都很忙吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "50aa3dc9cac9c943d0dae497f72f3a7cf530e6e50e6abda4faa9a57b09b71471", "ja": "それは……なんとかします。", "zh": "那个……我会想办法的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1022_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "edace0bec4413f72b69dce99008a1a04c7c4f6375500110d30b73393c85190ff", "ja": "…………そういうの、いい人ってやつ？", "zh": "…………那种人，就是所谓的好人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1024_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "4d00319525ff64ce36bc21af4965ff73d9d90c092073ee41cc3f99e81b783266", "ja": "野良ネコなんていっぱいいるのに。それで助けたつもり\nになってるの、ギゼンだって父ちゃんが言ってた。", "zh": "明明有那么多流浪猫。父亲说，觉得这样就算帮到它们了，是一种伪善。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1025_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "994e002dbf92826e14aa23cb8b7f62d29d497efb16bb3b4258507b61d88ddecd", "ja": "まあベンリだからいいけど。じゃあ渡したからね。", "zh": "不过挺方便的，也行吧。那我就交给你咯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1027_049mom", "source_sha256": "f9e29d398421b7ce4fa130ac062c270976c601fa2514a8b877865c56a91f7eeb", "ja": "ちょっと！　なにあれ！　勝手なことばかり言って！", "zh": "等等！那是什么！净说些自说自话的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1028_p", "source_sha256": "3aff554f0d1c6c8760b4e5d699101882c20ea66c07325a3bb35755a3ea06c7fc", "ja": "桃子、落ち着いて。\n……美奈子、大丈夫か？", "zh": "桃子，冷静一点。\n……美奈子，你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "344ace8099d003649f794a0d093f9f4e16cead8a6671ddc8d01cffee103cb7ff", "ja": "……あ、はいっ、大丈夫です。\nすみません、私、勝手なこと言って……。", "zh": "……啊，是的，我没事的。\n对不起，我说了这么任性的话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1030_019min", "source_sha256": "85462a55b997c6c05b086f990c988f8871b85f0ff5366ec0674e25232fc2c4cc", "ja": "あの、一度帰ってもいいですか？　この子のこと、\n家族と相談してきます。すぐ戻りますから。", "zh": "那个，我可以先回去一趟吗？关于这孩子的事，我想和家人商量一下。我马上就回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1031_049mom", "source_sha256": "486231d77251d16f10d88405198a791569e0a7fe3d0cc650247a740a05af0ae3", "ja": "でも……。\n美奈子さん、今すごく大変なのに……。", "zh": "可是……美奈子姐姐现在明明正忙得不可开交……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1032_019min", "source_sha256": "6fd22f4fcaecc9b0dbe830e32059b807c13d41244c7d7c68afd96fc143a2fe42", "ja": "平気だよ桃子ちゃん。\nできるだけ早く、飼い主さん見つけるから。", "zh": "没事的啦，桃子。\n我会尽快找到主人的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1033_p", "source_sha256": "7d176a8d70ee5f9dcd71ceaa114104d61202de3fdd94f49a1fc11af92ce6e3d0", "ja": "……わかった。美奈子、この子は一旦、\n劇場の事務室で預かるよ。", "zh": "……我知道了。美奈子，这孩子就先\n寄放在剧场的办公室吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
