{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1035_p", "source_sha256": "da63fe1443b70ac1192dfdc843dc431bee0ed270276dbf3ffd5f854c919e58c5", "ja": "まず動物病院に行って、色々チェックしてもらってから\nだけどな。劇場なら昼間は誰かしらいるし、夜は……", "zh": "不过，得先去动物医院，让他们检查一下各种情况才行。剧场的话，白天总会有人在，晚上就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1036_p", "source_sha256": "19c2c06d595fa84ec7637cf2166588d0cae91cc643f829a84d2e7c43a1276319", "ja": "まあ守衛さんに頼んだり、俺も居残ったりで\nなんとかなる。急ごう！", "zh": "也可以拜托门卫，或者我留下来加班，\n总会有办法的。赶紧走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "00bf24f181b5ffd5732fd72fb6acdf31df3c9bf9aec4ffeecba0002c718c4e37", "ja": "それで子猫がいたんですね。びっくりしました。\nまだだいぶ小さいですね……環のこぶんより。", "zh": "原来是这样，那里有只小猫啊。我吓了一跳。还小得很呢……比环的小弟还小。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1039_p", "source_sha256": "fa5ce790b8de39950c2f3f2fe4a2755519f3b97e086a5fd4fdf1b5c3ef2e2be2", "ja": "検査はしてもらったけど、念のためこぶんとは会わせ\nないように……桃子、環に伝えておいてくれるか？", "zh": "虽然已经做过检查了，但以防万一，还是别让它和小伙伴见面……桃子，你能帮我转告环境吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1040_049mom", "source_sha256": "4f3a98498ac6336739883ef1be75dea2a85a03bf989ecd3fee47a711b0e47c02", "ja": "うん、さっき言ったよ。\n環、すっごく遊びたがってたけど。", "zh": "嗯，刚才跟她说了。\n不过环看起来非常想跟它玩呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1041_p", "source_sha256": "a6118c570225b344a2003ab4bef725ce78dba297fe38022b3adb3e330a89e242", "ja": "そうだろうな。\nでも拾ったばかりだし、あんまりかまうのも……。", "zh": "确实如此。\n不过毕竟才刚捡回来，也不能一直逗它……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1042_011ami", "source_sha256": "6bc0beab0c082e2e23ced20a612f4d94ea93881b7b3712eaec18ea63dd4ce8db", "ja": "ちなみにオスだったよ！\nさっき確かめたから安心してね！", "zh": "顺便说一下，是公的哦！\n我刚才确认过了，所以放心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1043_p", "source_sha256": "dcffba336a716293739d387f6aa21188ea7c05bb706497674e8189550329d81c", "ja": "いつのまに！？\nいや、病院でもう聞いてたけどな？", "zh": "什么时候弄清的！？\n不对，其实在医院的时候就已经听说了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
