{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1045_019min", "source_sha256": "2795476f656674b38242c9da31cc30d4cf33b370ba96f7c4c0433fdc1bb586b4", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n簡単ですけどトイレとお布団、作ってきました。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n虽然比较简陋，但我弄好了厕所和铺盖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1046_p", "source_sha256": "b2b2dc28b22d3c14be2e965dc0335d568c95223440f385103626791e0b48dd1b", "ja": "おお、ありがとう、美奈子。", "zh": "哦，谢谢你，美奈子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1047_019min", "source_sha256": "47b633a933cfea9ec51c9e5393a8191ec664d15ad69a627eca83c648a61386b8", "ja": "こちらこそです。すみません、私が預かるっていった\nのに……。急いで飼ってくれる人を探しますね。", "zh": "我才要谢谢你。对不起，明明说好由我来照顾的……我会赶紧找愿意收养它的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1048_p", "source_sha256": "4d517d2a3e037ecc8264f0d0acd59c74749a0804586b66e2cfaeb57a82286c91", "ja": "いや、わかるよ。\nああいうのを見ちゃうとな。", "zh": "没事，我懂的。\n看到那种情况，确实没办法不管啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1049_049mom", "source_sha256": "3a86923043ab37a9db22a1520a7a869073c680228b62b5cbe5f029049f18a594", "ja": "でも、この子、すごく痩せてる……大丈夫かな。\nご飯も、さっきから食べないの。", "zh": "可是，这孩子也太瘦了……没事吧。\n从刚才开始就一直不吃饭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1050_p", "source_sha256": "e22cc36ab3e3de41c2d721c1c417f062537f59411292915a55b87463495b2ab4", "ja": "病院では、健康状態には問題ないってことだったから…\nまだ慣れてないせいかな。", "zh": "医生说健康状况没问题……\n可能只是还没习惯吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1051_019min", "source_sha256": "258a4dd70e9d9e4e09788eb7370230284cdba0666ae85650e8219812e420c958", "ja": "……大丈夫だよ、桃子ちゃん。\n落ち着いたら、きっとご飯もいっぱい食べてくれるよ。", "zh": "……没事的，桃子。\n等它平静下来，肯定就会吃很多饭的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1052_019min", "source_sha256": "cedb1ae6ce231be5e809cc068eb162ec07d79f59457e93c93f09e7d82d29d44b", "ja": "今は緊張してるか……このご飯が好きじゃないのかも。\n子猫用フードはいろいろ買って来たから、えっと……。", "zh": "现在是因为紧张吗……或者，只是不喜欢这个食物呢。\n我买了好几种幼猫粮，所以，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1053_019min", "source_sha256": "307d37bdb94722e169d661157852f1163aa5d4dc7ab84576455e29607a119cef", "ja": "……これならどうかな？\nよかったら、食べてね。", "zh": "……这个怎么样呢？\n可以的话，就吃一点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1054_koneko", "source_sha256": "c458b11d0bca2409afc738ef24513fc8ac51ba6778a4c4903adf0018a36053fd", "ja": "フーッ！　シャー！！", "zh": "呼——！　哈——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
