{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1058_019min", "source_sha256": "8169b72730ac569c6534beb5b28631bcf2bb5da5d0a5ecd162a4fd528b2ef304", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です、かすっただけですから。\n……ごめんね、驚かせちゃったね……。", "zh": "没、没事，只是擦伤了一下而已。\n……对不起，吓到你了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1059_039kon", "source_sha256": "bff4b6b7135e34440db9e10ddfbbee07c4f54deac94abf4a44795bd98d0618af", "ja": "一応消毒しておきましょう。……野良猫だから、急に\n人に囲まれて、興奮しちゃったのかもしれないわね。", "zh": "以防万一，先消毒一下吧。……毕竟是只流浪猫，突然被人围住，可能有点激动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1060_p", "source_sha256": "9f851c8b66a084b315ba390660a5bd3bf424796cb6b298e84f66c72cf4c18fdb", "ja": "とりあえず、もう少し静かな場所に移します。\nみんなも不用意にさわらないようにな。…亜美もだぞ？", "zh": "总之，先把它移到安静一点的地方吧。\n大家也别贸然去碰它。……包括亚美，知道了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1061_011ami", "source_sha256": "27ecf364defddddc1007c6aff5f25d515ef9830bfa7d6006642659a6c38aee04", "ja": "うん。なんかめっちゃ毛が逆立ってるしねー。\nあとでたっぷり、オモチャで語り合おう！", "zh": "嗯。总感觉毛都炸得厉害呢～\n待会儿再用玩具和你好好交流交流！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1062_p", "source_sha256": "01d1fb28b1fe05bca557730b9487c2d871c2283596358c74cdae6cf193ee4106", "ja": "美奈子もな。……怒られたことは気にするな。\n今は誰に対しても気が立ってるだけだろうから。", "zh": "美奈子也是。……别在意被骂的事。她现在大概只是对谁都很烦躁而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1063_019min", "source_sha256": "670edd38f0edccfda4bcedc8a84199a470d2651c601cb594916abfdba8ab5b2e", "ja": "あ、はい……、私は大丈夫です。\n……キミも、大丈夫だからね？　大丈夫……。", "zh": "啊，好的……我没事。\n……你也没事的哦？没事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1065_019min", "source_sha256": "b5b632c537904925e136621f05abb2c011f8a944dbf84abfbf97db2b3deb72da", "ja": "こうして…………うん、これでよし、っと。\n琥太朗、どう？　貼り紙、まっすぐ貼れてる？", "zh": "就这样……嗯，这下就好了。  \n琥太朗，怎么样？这张告示贴得正不正？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1066_kotarou", "source_sha256": "5f68e5d48a51bea00a1c9ba2dcdb1acea70cb2383418cbb885585ef38d0011ff", "ja": "うん、いいと思う。\n子猫もらってくれる人、見つかるかなぁ。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得挺好的。\n不知道能不能找到收养小猫的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1067_019min", "source_sha256": "02c1f2115a870e86ca38bc1703d42b6779ddcacab8268fb0eb2b111a5b4c6f71", "ja": "きっと見つかるよ。こんなに可愛い子猫なんだもん。\n……あ、いらっしゃいませー！", "zh": "一定能找到的啦。这么可爱的小猫咪……\n……啊，欢迎光临——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1068_jyourennkyakua", "source_sha256": "8b3589c709d8317d84321f1ef6eeb06f550f6aa6785e685b6a1ec4695ab3e231", "ja": "おっ、美奈子ちゃん、その貼り紙、捨て猫かい？\nふむふむ、オスの子猫1匹、かぁ。", "zh": "哦，美奈子，那张告示上说的是被遗弃的小猫吗？\n嗯嗯，公的小猫1只啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1069_019min", "source_sha256": "6e97827ec964f28b5f6fb9580f1be49b04178cc8ef3c044d9f8e5d17c8a7d50e", "ja": "そうなんです。とっても可愛いんですよ！\nあ、チラシもありますから、よかったらどうぞ！", "zh": "是的，特别可爱哦！\n啊，这里还有传单，您要是不嫌弃就拿一张吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1070_jyourennkyakua", "source_sha256": "8258dcbb15e24a140422d7384dd8646a2ab106e30c71852da32b313fac655181", "ja": "美奈子ちゃんは相変わらず優しいねぇ。\n捨て猫なんていっぱいいるだろうに。", "zh": "你还是一如既往地温柔啊，美奈子。明明被丢弃的小猫应该有很多吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1071_jyourennkyakub", "source_sha256": "86d5a22d1c9f9ec0cab810388942e8144bde035a8603a4905687cf1d60e62887", "ja": "キリなくないかい？　ま、でもそこが美奈子ちゃんの\nいいところだよなぁ。チラシ、もらっとくよ。", "zh": "没完没了的吧？不过，美奈子，这也是你的优点啊。传单我就收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1072_019min", "source_sha256": "99eda54eb2844e4d3d31c37e9712a10d86b318619d7d2ba216675693b760b2f8", "ja": "あ……。はい、ありがとうございます！\nよろしくお願いしますね。", "zh": "啊……好的。谢谢您！\n那就拜托您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1074_kotarou", "source_sha256": "368f33816b4013b4712715e6481c9b3dacb74cef977617a1397c951a0bd80bf4", "ja": "……お姉ちゃん？", "zh": "……姐姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1075_019min", "source_sha256": "4ce6575fb978cb629d9b4bb0011b8db96b9aa1b57c4473312789b282fdb59e28", "ja": "え？　……あ、ううん、なんでもないよ。\nそれじゃ、お手伝いに戻ろっか。", "zh": "诶？……啊，没什么。\n那我们回去帮忙吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1076_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1077_p", "source_sha256": "e28e158f1419b2f2eb156422051120e274728845726f669e91c4d82fb41bdec1", "ja": "（ソロ公演が近くなってきたが……、美奈子、\nあまりレッスンに集中できていないみたいだな）", "zh": "个人公演越来越近了，可是……美奈子好像没法好好集中精神练习啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1078_p", "source_sha256": "38d61f2802cd66f7fe00e570068e4503dec0a875e0029e7673583b38e74e00f8", "ja": "（ちょっと様子を見てこよう）", "zh": "（我去看看她的情况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1079_p", "source_sha256": "6a2a46393f833f345cd2d56aed393eb19a167072a32b950243996b1c402df246", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様。\n……あれ？　美奈子は？", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n……咦？美奈子呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1080_015siz", "source_sha256": "43e27acbb3b0f85638e37d5bcac1c3388865905ef32e462fbb8db8a28ebc5142", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。美奈子さん\nと桃子は、もうすぐ合流……あれ？　もう時間ですね。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。美奈子\n和桃子马上就要过来了……咦？已经到时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1081_p", "source_sha256": "61b38e394665dea66d78c7744dea747b2b0754a6257db1c03d0a57b006c25a6a", "ja": "見当たらなかったから、こっちかと思ったんだけどな。\nそうか……。", "zh": "那边没看到，我以为在这里……\n原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1082_039kon", "source_sha256": "ef71514ec52cf6bfd1bc8508f9d44ffadcb5778b714f7a7fa2d9c4cd8bfb919e", "ja": "じゃあまた、子猫の所かしら。\nちょっと見てきましょうか。", "zh": "那要不还是去小猫那边看看吧。\n我去看一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1083_p", "source_sha256": "c08d1ac1d465566bed3c7245a28a41504485ca3fe9418bf1221e9703c17827f1", "ja": "いえ、このみさんたちはレッスンを続けててください。\n……でもやっぱり、子猫の所か。", "zh": "不用，木实你们继续练习吧。\n……不过果然还是在小猫那里吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1084_011ami", "source_sha256": "fa435af1e547944cec150bb306862a1ff4a13b2d45e3a5b92a2700baf3007236", "ja": "みなりん、カイガイしいんだよー。\nいろんなご飯作ったり、お布団替えたり。", "zh": "美奈子可勤快了——  \n又是做各种各样的饭，又是帮忙换被褥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1085_039kon", "source_sha256": "7c79fb64232e416616b28d9bee1bd635b9e04118d18e5a4d8727f807284d95e8", "ja": "私たちも手伝ってるんだけど、\nどうしても気になるみたい。", "zh": "我们也有帮忙，\n但她就是忍不住想多操心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1086_015siz", "source_sha256": "fabf0ff0c8449775d3e2816be2bd2272130fa602ba6ef1775909c074302f4f8e", "ja": "そのぶん、私たちへの差し入れは無しにしてもらって\nるんですけど。なので今日は私が、うどんを。", "zh": "所以，相应地，我们就请她不要给我们送慰问品了。不过今天的乌冬面，就由我来送。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1087_p", "source_sha256": "25c291bc5c310604e6bb1dce3eb6678786b7caf09ed80616ca3a335bdb0fa508", "ja": "美奈子が、差し入れをしてない……？", "zh": "美奈子居然没准备慰问品……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1089_p", "source_sha256": "653aa290b1aba147b746a212bc7fb1a4b16e2ec637e7d7fa2c0adf10576f567c", "ja": "わかった。ありがとな。\nちょっと見に行ってくるよ。", "zh": "知道了。谢谢你啊。\n我去稍微看看情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1090_019min", "source_sha256": "f2e8f4e1d9dee2aafe2d169ced82d8cb048d5f4e2e88390d5d042ccaa4767b26", "ja": "……今度のご飯はどうかな。\nもう少し、食べてくれるといいんだけどな。", "zh": "……这次的饭菜合不合胃口呢。\n要是能多吃一点就好了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1091_se", "source_sha256": "3a39d65a9e257a09dba8ba313e22f361fa16a436a844d53adea33765d9923175", "ja": "キィ……", "zh": "嘎叽……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1092_p", "source_sha256": "e2514bdaf5581d028104719515dc6e8d3e8fed8b85c9f6d89f827d41c62e63b0", "ja": "美奈子……やっぱりここか。\n今、ちょっと話せるか？　控え室とかで。", "zh": "美奈子……果然在这里啊。\n现在方便聊聊吗？去休息室之类的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1093_019min", "source_sha256": "43e1c33de8b5e349eb58e09131a4d4763441c11a14333fb5d9978826c09f3a89", "ja": "{$P$}さん。……はい、\nすぐ行きます。……じゃあ、またね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。……好的，\n我马上就去。……那我先走啦，回头见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1094_019min", "source_sha256": "e122464a0ac57e65b940bed289cfe06c23739082bfbf26f8087c13987e579f9e", "ja": "あの子、ちょっと慣れてきたんですよ。\nご飯は、まだあんまり食べてくれないんですけど。", "zh": "那孩子已经渐渐习惯了。\n虽然……还是不太肯吃饭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1095_019min", "source_sha256": "58450040ba1d5c506b0a19473c083d74e5838cfd1b59e5f68f734375e9aec623", "ja": "{$P$}さんは……あ、もしかして、\nお腹すいちゃいました？　すぐ何か作りますね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生是……啊，难不成，\n您肚子饿了吗？我马上做点吃的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1096_p", "source_sha256": "35831e4f860ecf03e22be2b4a68cfa9061d9dea6c8a712d9578156cca52b8cbd", "ja": "美奈子、トレーナーさんが心配してたんだ。\n最近、ボイトレがあまりうまくいってないって。", "zh": "美奈子，训练师很担心你。她说你最近的声乐训练不太顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1097_019min", "source_sha256": "6e7af113d544b7a6bd30b1667bff93c088d694c437e4c21880a0f14273bddde6", "ja": "あ……すみません、私……。公演も近いのに。", "zh": "啊……对不起，我……明明公演也快到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1098_p", "source_sha256": "471bc01c26fd892b3242c84a491f96d7a16ff858f2f1917c4eeffca3a74496c0", "ja": "前に言ってた、上手に気持ちを込めて歌いたいって\n言ってたところ……サビのちょっと難しい部分だよな。", "zh": "你之前说过，想要好好地把感情融入歌声——\n说的就是那一段吧，副歌里稍微有点难的部分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1099_p", "source_sha256": "df98aeb6a854505af945315eb90d8f06d106ab261b0ad049d4f0b0c1c62f181a", "ja": "あそこは、思い切りがないと歌えない。\n……歌う気になれないか？", "zh": "那里要是没有豁出去的决心，可唱不好。\n……是不想唱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1100_019min", "source_sha256": "b3da6673d756a00bc4843eb746476a7ac7de146e79a368be5bc17f1f8623cdce", "ja": "！　違います！　大好きです！", "zh": "！不是的！我最喜欢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1101_019min", "source_sha256": "21c029cc0a8220946968d90cadcd12c67484a133925ac76083fd76b7c64799a4", "ja": "あの歌を聴いた時、すごく感動して、\nあんな歌を作ってもらえたのが、嬉しくて、私……。", "zh": "听到那首歌的时候，我非常感动，\n能为我写出那样的歌，我真的好开心，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1102_019min", "source_sha256": "e535b3b02cd42c9702e7397c1fb8e95eb490c14fcdb388b839e955b5557f0aae", "ja": "ただ、違うんです、その……、\nお節介って、難しいなぁって。", "zh": "只是，不是这样的，那个……\n我只是觉得，替别人操心还真难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1103_019min", "source_sha256": "7d2dfbdd9d0bb67881bf1c9299221cf4e02e84f5a498b27e6c8b52f8f457fe4b", "ja": "するって決めたんです。ワガママになろうって。\nだから、何を言われたってかまわないはずなんです。", "zh": "我已经决定要这么做了。要任性一次。\n所以，不管别人说什么，我都不该在意才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1104_019min", "source_sha256": "7a529681e1494090c0ceb9ea3dfa41af3ec59d6ed399fde318e6e58362a45c99", "ja": "だけど……、私のワガママだって、わかってることを\n続けるのって……えへへ、難しいんですねっ。", "zh": "可是……明知道这是我的任性，还要继续下去……嘿嘿，真的很难呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1106_p", "source_sha256": "f8af8e4026e03f9c7260949dd9c1424c00d4d47bdce848e1b493349004aa545c", "ja": "そうだな。他の誰かの本当の気持ちは、どうしたって\nわからないし……それは難しいよ。", "zh": "是啊。无论如何，都不可能知道其他人的真实想法……这确实很难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1107_p", "source_sha256": "f9c8e846edc2c551de8f61bbc35b101f22cd5f35faed609d64817d27e48c65dd", "ja": "……じゃあ、今はやめておくか？", "zh": "……那现在就先算了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1108_019min", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1109_p", "source_sha256": "d79eeb86e5ed44497dedae875976d42dfa0399fa13987804fdc8fc717c18d61c", "ja": "今回の新曲、美奈子のために作ってもらった歌だけど…\n今の美奈子には辛いなら、歌う時じゃないとも思う。", "zh": "这次的新歌，虽然是请人专门为美奈子创作的……  \n但如果对现在的美奈子来说太过痛苦，我觉得也还不是该唱的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_146_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_146_1110_p", "source_sha256": "655d1f22e18e4b45773903e57a0209dc071e9fa8f0bed00fc564bd56ada93d07", "ja": "あれは、心から歌える時に歌ってほしいんだ。\n……これはプロデューサーのワガママだけど。", "zh": "那首歌，我希望你能在打心底想唱的时候去唱。\n……虽然这也只是制作人的任性罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
